title INS Vikrant: what the caller sees
direction right
You [shape: oval, icon: user, color: blue, label: "You, away from your desk"]
Phone [icon: phone, color: blue, label: "Call the INS Vikrant number"]
Voice [icon: mic, color: purple, label: "Voice agent restates the question and names the mission"]
Crew [color: orange] {
  Captain [icon: anchor, label: "Captain launches the crew"]
  Fundamentals [icon: file-text, label: "Fundamentals scout reads the earnings release"]
  News [icon: rss, label: "News scout reads 30 days of headlines"]
  Readacross [icon: share-2, label: "Read-across scout checks suppliers and rivals"]
  Checker [icon: shield, color: red, label: "Evidence checker re-fetches every source and drops unproven claims"]
  Debate [icon: message-circle, label: "Bull and Bear argue, then rebut each other"]
  Verdict [icon: check-circle, color: green, label: "Captain rules: Supports, Mixed or Contradicts"]
}
Push [icon: bell, color: green, label: "Push on your phone with the verdict and claim counts"]
Memo [icon: file, color: green, label: "Tap for the memo and mission timeline"]
CallBack [icon: phone-call, color: blue, label: "Call back: status, why, or stop"]
You > Phone: ask a question out loud
Phone > Voice
Voice > Captain: mission brief
Captain > Fundamentals
Captain > News
Captain > Readacross
Fundamentals > Checker: claims with quotes
News > Checker
Readacross > Checker
Checker > Debate: checked claims only
Debate > Verdict
Verdict > Push
Push > Memo
Memo > CallBack
CallBack > Voice: answer is spoken back
